<title>CHINA: TRADING IN LOGIC INT'L SHRS SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN LOGIC INT'L SHRS SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of office furniture distributor Logic International Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday morning at the company's request, pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The stock closed HK$0.125 higher at HK$2.35 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
